**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
.git/
.notes/
.claude/
docs/
# Excluded wholesale except control-api, which the control-api Dockerfile builds from this same
# repo-root context (needed so it can also reach the root Directory.Packages.props) - the
# `dir/*` + `!dir/sub` pairs are required because a plain trailing-slash exclusion can't be
# selectively un-excluded below it.
sandbox/*
!sandbox/infra
sandbox/infra/*
!sandbox/infra/control-api
src/frontend/**/node_modules/
src/frontend/**/dist/
